sequenceDiagram
    actor Recruiter
    participant UI as RMS Portal
    participant RMS as Recruitment Service
    participant AI as AI Matching Engine
    participant DB as Database
    actor Candidate

    Recruiter->>UI: Login

    Recruiter->>UI: Create Job Description
    UI->>RMS: Save Job
    RMS->>DB: Store JD
    DB-->>RMS: Success

    Recruiter->>UI: Configure AI Weightage
    UI->>AI: Calculate Candidate Ranking
    AI->>DB: Fetch Candidates
    DB-->>AI: Candidate Data
    AI-->>UI: Ranked Candidates

    Recruiter->>UI: Invite Candidate
    UI->>RMS: Send Invitation
    RMS->>DB: Store Invitation

    Candidate->>UI: Accept Invitation

    Recruiter->>UI: Hire Candidate
    UI->>RMS: Update Hiring Status
    RMS->>DB: Save Hiring Details
    DB-->>RMS: Success

    RMS-->>Candidate: Offer Letter